  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞保健室……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:0:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伊丽莎白和玛格丽特\n　正在里面交谈……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 02 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……这个假说，你觉得如何？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}应该不能断言……毫无可能吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}我认为值得一试。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}是吗……那么，果然还是发布委托吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}客人来这里时，\n记得自然地向他提一下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}“那件事”先不要说。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0F 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}明白了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞看来两人还没有发现你……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}在说悄悄话？{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}那个……{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 05 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}有刺客！\n来人啊！快来人啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0B 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}这里没有别人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 05 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}所有人，退下！退下！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}真是的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0102",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 02 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}不过，你来得正好。\n有件事要告诉你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0102",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}我发布了１项委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:11:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0102",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}内容就是，与我“切磋”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:11:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_0102",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}虽然稍微有点难度，\n但完成后，会有“惊喜”等着你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0103",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}有空的话……不，即使没空，\n也十分推荐你承接。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0103",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}那么……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞玛格丽特离开了房间……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_200.bf.json:14:0",
